# SmartTavern .gitattributes (M0-T0)
#
# LF everywhere in the repository: docs and tools parse file bytes, and the
# .stpack determinism tests hash payload files, so text must not be rewritten
# on checkout. See docs/04-分享格式规范.md §11.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows-only helpers keep CRLF so they stay runnable after a checkout.
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf

# Binary payloads: never normalize, never diff.
*.stpack binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.zip binary
*.wasm binary
